<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the quarter-finals of the $926,250 Italian Open women's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seed):</p>
<p>3-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Joannette Kruger (South Africa) 6-0 6-4  </p>
<p>11-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat 7-Irina Spirlea (Romania) 6-4 6-2  </p>
<p>10-Mary Pierce (France) beat 14-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) 6-3 6-4  </p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat 12-Sergei Bruguera (Spain) 6-4 7-6 (7-3).</p>
</text>
